              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="4">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Simulates the arrival-side baggage recheck queue. Following the TypeScript model this is the desk facility for the International→Domestic transfer flow: transfer passengers re-lodge checked bags and re-clear into the BHS. Serves transfer flows whose scenario rules require baggage recheck; everyone else passes through. The full passenger population is returned.</item>
