                    <chunk name="param_input" index="9">
                      <items count="7">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Simulate the checkpoint as two queues in series: an entry e-gate stage (pool 'EGate', default 1 gate, 7 s, 2 min MQT) feeding an ATRS screening stage (pool 'ATRS'). Every passenger queues at the e-gate first, is served, then queues for a screening lane.</item>
